data: {"type": "assistant_msg", "ts": "2026-08-06T12:23:32.163289+00:00", "content": "Based on available telemetry for **ce_branch24** [metrics:0-19], no explicit fault logs or incident records are retrievable (logs return empty; incidents backend unavailable). Observable anomalies from live metrics that would map to a `faults` table:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n  'ce_branch24'                           AS device,\n  ts                                      AS fault_ts,\n  CASE\n    WHEN metric = 'iface_queue_drops' AND value > 0\n         THEN 'interface_queue_drops'\n    WHEN metric = 'sdwan_tunnel_jitter_ms' AND value > 50\n         THEN 'tunnel_high_jitter'\n    WHEN metric = 'sdwan_tunnel_latency_ms' AND value > 100\n         THEN 'tunnel_high_latency'\n    WHEN metric = 'sdwan_tunnel_rekeys_total' AND value > 20\n         THEN 'tunnel_frequent_rekeys'\n  END                                     AS fault_type,\n  COALESCE(interface, tunnel)             AS component,\n  value                                   AS metric_value,\n  'live_metrics'                          AS source\nFROM (\n  SELECT 1786018944 AS ts, 'iface_queue_drops' AS metric, 'eth0' AS interface, NULL AS tunnel, 92 AS value\n  UNION ALL SELECT 1786018944, 'iface_queue_drops', 'eth1', NULL, 2\n  UNION ALL SELECT 1786018944, 'sdwan_tunnel_jitter_ms', NULL, 'ce_branch24-ce_hub3', 79.268\n  UNION ALL SELECT 1786018944, 'sdwan_tunnel_latency_ms', NULL, 'ce_branch24-ce_hub3', 108.9426\n  UNION ALL SELECT 1786018944, 'sdwan_tunnel_rekeys_total', NULL, 'ce_branch24-ce_hub2', 26\n) m\nWHERE fault_type IS NOT NULL\nORDER BY fault_ts;\n```\n\n**Resulting rows (derived from [metrics:6-7, metrics:2-3, metrics:8, metrics:19]):**\n\n| device       | fault_ts     | fault_type               | component                | metric_value | source       |\n|--------------|--------------|--------------------------|--------------------------|--------------|--------------|\n| ce_branch24  | 1786018944   | interface_queue_drops    | eth0                     | 92           | live_metrics |\n| ce_branch24  | 1786018944   | interface_queue_drops    | eth1                     | 2            | live_metrics |\n| ce_branch24  | 1786018944   | tunnel_high_jitter       | ce_branch24-ce_hub3      | 79.268       | live_metrics |\n| ce_branch24  | 1786018944   | tunnel_high_latency      | ce_branch24-ce_hub3      | 108.9426     | live_metrics |\n| ce_branch24  | 1786018944   | tunnel_frequent_rekeys   | ce_branch24-ce_hub2      | 26           | live_metrics |\n\n*No historical fault/incident rows could be fetched (incidents backend unavailable; log search returned no rows).*"}

